WEBVTT

01:12.950 --> 01:17.230
[Meet Yourself]

01:21.170 --> 01:23.450
[Episode 08]

01:31.014 --> 01:34.324
What he sent you is
obviously a phishing site.

01:36.084 --> 01:37.574
The police also told me that,

01:38.294 --> 01:39.734
asking me to wait at home.

01:40.454 --> 01:42.123
It's a phishing site?

01:42.124 --> 01:43.574
I'm their prey.

01:44.294 --> 01:45.933
They said I'm lucky enough.

01:45.934 --> 01:47.123
30,000 is not much?

01:47.124 --> 01:49.014
Don't mention it. Finish your food.

01:52.374 --> 01:54.484
You must have not eaten for three days.

01:55.044 --> 01:56.604
I've eaten on the plane.

01:56.934 --> 01:58.574
Noodles and rice are both bad.

01:58.894 --> 02:00.654
But you still ate two sets.

02:05.014 --> 02:05.643
Wipe it.

02:05.644 --> 02:06.724
OK.

02:11.254 --> 02:15.484
Anyway, don't let my mom know it.

02:15.924 --> 02:17.174
She cherishes money.

02:17.454 --> 02:19.134
She'll be too sad to sleep.

02:19.924 --> 02:21.534
And don't let Xiaochun know it.

02:21.974 --> 02:23.414
She always hates me.

02:24.044 --> 02:25.453
If she finds my mistake,

02:25.454 --> 02:27.014
she'll laugh at me forever.

02:28.174 --> 02:29.413
You think too much.

02:29.414 --> 02:30.924
She's not as what you think.

02:31.804 --> 02:33.604
Only you think she's a good woman.

02:36.174 --> 02:39.534
Anyway, I'll lend you the money.

02:40.044 --> 02:41.174
However,

02:41.524 --> 02:43.014
You should be prepared.

02:43.644 --> 02:46.204
It may take some time
to recover the money

02:46.924 --> 02:48.484
from online fraud.

02:51.254 --> 02:52.334
I know.

02:55.134 --> 02:57.044
Do you also think I'm a fool?

02:59.454 --> 03:00.694
No.

03:01.134 --> 03:03.363
You're too easy to get carried away

03:03.364 --> 03:04.644
with easy money.

03:08.324 --> 03:09.484
I'm greedy.

03:17.764 --> 03:20.013
Why not visit Shanghai for two days?

03:20.014 --> 03:21.364
I will pay for your trip.

03:21.854 --> 03:23.133
I won't.

03:23.134 --> 03:24.603
I'll stay here for two days.

03:24.604 --> 03:26.884
I'll go back when Shanghai specialties arrive.

03:36.294 --> 03:39.084
He is in big trouble.

03:39.974 --> 03:43.853
When he first came
back, no one helped him.

03:43.854 --> 03:46.134
At that time, Xiaochun had not come.

03:46.524 --> 03:52.043
His father couldn't help him at all

03:52.044 --> 03:55.453
and troubled him all
day long, like a weight

03:55.454 --> 03:56.974
hanging on his feet.

03:57.254 --> 03:59.253
Auntie, tofu is ready.

03:59.254 --> 04:00.734
Thank you.

04:02.044 --> 04:02.923
Hongdou.

04:02.924 --> 04:03.294
For you.

04:03.295 --> 04:04.293
For me?

04:04.294 --> 04:05.454
Thank you, granny.

04:06.974 --> 04:09.084
But why did his father trouble him?

04:09.644 --> 04:12.693
He thought it was
hard to cultivate

04:12.694 --> 04:14.294
an outstanding son.

04:15.164 --> 04:16.813
But his son returned.

04:16.814 --> 04:18.414
He didn't agree.

04:19.574 --> 04:21.124
Once,

04:21.404 --> 04:25.974
A villager opened an online shop but
it finally closed down.

04:26.404 --> 04:28.244
Yao took over.

04:28.524 --> 04:31.083
Later, someone set up an inn,

04:31.084 --> 04:32.933
which is the place where you live.

04:32.934 --> 04:36.893
It also closed down,
and Yao took over.

04:36.894 --> 04:40.963
Even the tie-dye
workshop he took over

04:40.964 --> 04:45.364
is the one beyond
someone's ability to run.

05:02.014 --> 05:04.044
Why are there so few tourists?

05:04.614 --> 05:06.774
No one came to inquire for a long time.

05:07.284 --> 05:08.684
Take it easy.

05:10.164 --> 05:12.723
We've been sitting here for two hours.

05:12.724 --> 05:15.044
Just two hours.

05:17.084 --> 05:19.214
Business is usually like this.

05:19.814 --> 05:21.373
If it is market day,

05:21.374 --> 05:23.804
more people will ask for the price.

05:24.454 --> 05:26.174
How much can you sell?

05:26.494 --> 05:28.654
I can't produce much.

05:29.204 --> 05:30.774
Can you make money?

05:31.284 --> 05:38.334
I can afford the oil, salt and snacks for
children.

05:39.054 --> 05:41.083
As long as I'm alive,

05:41.084 --> 05:42.723
I shouldn't ask others for help.

05:42.724 --> 05:45.654
It's not good to ask children for things.

05:46.964 --> 05:50.493
Recently, I've saved more money.

05:50.494 --> 05:54.124
That's Yuan's pocket money at school.

05:55.014 --> 05:56.734
How much?

05:59.894 --> 06:01.124
3000?

06:02.134 --> 06:03.564
300.

06:06.134 --> 06:07.214
Well.

06:07.644 --> 06:10.493
I also save money for Yao.

06:10.494 --> 06:12.083
Why do you save money for him?

06:12.084 --> 06:14.004
For his marriage.

06:15.204 --> 06:16.573
Since he went to college,

06:16.574 --> 06:18.573
I've started to save money.

06:18.574 --> 06:20.693
I've saved money for years.

06:20.694 --> 06:22.214
How much?

06:24.934 --> 06:26.364
It's a secret.

06:31.524 --> 06:34.133
1, 1, 2, 1.

06:34.134 --> 06:35.813
1, 2, 1.

06:35.814 --> 06:37.774
1, 2, 1.

06:39.894 --> 06:41.643
1, 2, 1.

06:41.644 --> 06:43.403
1, 2, 1.

06:43.404 --> 06:44.793
Haven't you heard?

06:44.794 --> 06:46.214
You can't walk any further?

06:46.724 --> 06:47.974
Come on.

06:49.254 --> 06:51.253
[Runyuan Inn of Old Town]

06:51.254 --> 06:52.933
1, 2, 1.

06:52.934 --> 06:54.484
1, 2, 1.

07:00.284 --> 07:01.933
1, 2, 1.

07:01.934 --> 07:03.484
This way.

07:10.054 --> 07:13.643
Send me the gas distribution phone number.

07:13.644 --> 07:14.724
Wait.

07:15.204 --> 07:16.564
Where are you?

07:17.404 --> 07:18.484
In the Bund.

07:19.644 --> 07:21.334
You went to the Bund in the day?

07:23.164 --> 07:23.764
OK.

07:23.765 --> 07:24.854
I see.

07:25.084 --> 07:26.364
Have a good time.

07:30.144 --> 07:31.224
Time to go home.

07:31.574 --> 07:32.654
Guobao.

07:33.284 --> 07:34.364
Go.

07:35.454 --> 07:36.534
Mom.

07:36.934 --> 07:38.373
Class is over?

07:38.374 --> 07:40.163
Guanjun, I have some matters.

07:40.164 --> 07:41.813
Could I let her have dinner with you?

07:41.814 --> 07:42.894
OK.

07:44.134 --> 07:45.684
Behave well.

07:45.964 --> 07:47.334
I have to go.

07:48.084 --> 07:49.083
Bye-bye!

07:49.084 --> 07:50.403
Bye-bye!

07:50.404 --> 07:51.534
Bye-bye!

07:52.724 --> 07:54.403
Your mom is quite busy.

07:54.404 --> 07:55.134
Of course.

07:55.135 --> 07:57.294
A woman should focus on work.

07:57.964 --> 07:59.723
Who taught you that?

07:59.724 --> 08:01.133
Nana told me.

08:01.134 --> 08:02.203
Great.

08:02.204 --> 08:03.083
Let's go home.

08:03.084 --> 08:04.723
Guobao, walk ahead.

08:04.724 --> 08:05.254
Go home.

08:05.254 --> 08:06.334
Go.

08:09.964 --> 08:11.604
So beautiful!

08:12.524 --> 08:14.323
It's cute.

08:14.324 --> 08:15.933
Let's have a look over there.

08:15.934 --> 08:17.014
Go.

08:28.494 --> 08:30.574
[Yuan]

08:31.494 --> 08:33.163
More than 100 call-back messages?

08:33.164 --> 08:34.443
What's the matter?

08:34.444 --> 08:35.333
Where are you?

08:35.334 --> 08:36.724
None of your business.

08:37.644 --> 08:39.973
Original Flavor Hotpot Restaurant.

08:39.974 --> 08:41.333
He turned it on last night.

08:41.334 --> 08:41.894
Give me.

08:41.895 --> 08:43.684
I'm wondering how to find him.

08:44.014 --> 08:45.204
Yuan.

08:46.194 --> 08:47.043
I've found him!

08:47.044 --> 08:48.163
Liang.

08:48.164 --> 08:49.684
What are you doing?

08:50.164 --> 08:51.283
Who?

08:51.284 --> 08:52.613
Your family?

08:52.614 --> 08:53.774
No.

08:54.284 --> 08:57.013
Over 100 messages.

08:57.014 --> 08:58.654
From the girl who likes you?

08:59.524 --> 09:01.523
Just a woman who
came to rent a house.

09:01.524 --> 09:02.654
Forget it.

09:02.894 --> 09:04.613
Lady.

09:04.614 --> 09:08.444
Original Flavor Wild Fungi

09:09.374 --> 09:10.614
Hotpot.

09:11.444 --> 09:12.724
Yuan is here.

09:13.494 --> 09:14.523
Go.

09:14.524 --> 09:14.854
Wait.

09:14.855 --> 09:16.643
I have to call President Xie.

09:16.644 --> 09:17.724
No need.

09:17.974 --> 09:19.493
He knows where Yuan is.

09:19.494 --> 09:20.523
He doesn't tell me.

09:20.524 --> 09:21.683
Why doesn't he tell you?

09:21.684 --> 09:22.924
I don't know.

09:24.214 --> 09:24.853
Granny.

09:24.854 --> 09:26.333
Watch the stall for me.

09:26.334 --> 09:28.724
Slow down.

09:32.334 --> 09:34.324
You're boring!

09:38.214 --> 09:39.494
Hello, Xiaxia.

09:41.014 --> 09:42.373
OK.

09:42.374 --> 09:43.164
I'll be off at 3.

09:43.164 --> 09:44.244
I have free time.

09:44.614 --> 09:45.613
OK.

09:45.614 --> 09:46.724
OK.

09:49.804 --> 09:51.044
Cut up vegetables.

09:51.524 --> 09:52.604
Got it.

09:55.524 --> 09:56.683
Granny.

09:56.684 --> 09:58.213
Granny, slow down.

09:58.214 --> 09:59.493
Mind your step.

09:59.494 --> 09:59.804
No.

09:59.805 --> 10:01.374
Shall we call a taxi?

10:05.134 --> 10:05.804
Granny, Hongdou.

10:05.804 --> 10:06.564
Where to go?

10:06.565 --> 10:07.443
To Old Town.

10:07.444 --> 10:08.493
Why?

10:08.494 --> 10:09.493
To find...

10:09.494 --> 10:10.684
Eat hot pot.

10:11.044 --> 10:12.133
I have something to do.

10:12.134 --> 10:13.043
Get into the car.

10:13.044 --> 10:14.333
Give us a lift.

10:14.334 --> 10:15.414
Go.

10:18.734 --> 10:19.814
Granny, slow down.

10:20.214 --> 10:21.643
Fasten the seat belt.

10:21.644 --> 10:22.493
Come on.

10:22.494 --> 10:23.614
Let me help you.

10:24.614 --> 10:25.694
Sit upright.

10:40.974 --> 10:42.643
You'd better tie up the hair.

10:42.644 --> 10:43.643
I don't have a hairdo.

10:43.644 --> 10:45.084
I have one in the bag.

10:45.684 --> 10:46.764
OK.

10:53.854 --> 10:55.494
Is your car rented?

10:56.254 --> 10:57.283
I seldom drive.

10:57.284 --> 10:58.924
I rent one when in need.

10:59.804 --> 11:01.844
Why do you go to Old Town?

11:02.164 --> 11:03.254
To do business.

11:03.764 --> 11:05.213
Big business.

11:05.214 --> 11:07.614
Your emotion means you're
going to beat someone.

11:08.134 --> 11:10.294
Did your husband come?

11:11.214 --> 11:12.333
Granny.

11:12.334 --> 11:13.853
He's my ex-husband.

11:13.854 --> 11:15.324
We are divorced.

11:15.764 --> 11:17.093
And I'm not going to beat him.

11:17.094 --> 11:18.093
Don't worry.

11:18.094 --> 11:20.654
If I want, I'll
take you with me.

11:23.134 --> 11:24.643
Why do you eat
hotpot in Old Town?

11:24.644 --> 11:26.654
There's a hotpot restaurant in our town.

11:27.044 --> 11:30.133
There are many good comments on it.

11:30.134 --> 11:31.613
Granny has saved 300 yuan.

11:31.614 --> 11:32.683
It's her treat.

11:32.684 --> 11:34.204
Is that true, granny?

11:35.644 --> 11:36.683
Granny.

11:36.684 --> 11:37.733
You're partial.

11:37.734 --> 11:39.444
You just take Hongdou.

11:39.854 --> 11:42.093
Aren't you going to
beat your husband?

11:42.094 --> 11:44.403
He's my ex-husband. I've abandoned him.

11:44.404 --> 11:46.093
Why not be happy?

11:46.094 --> 11:47.174
Yes, I'm happy.

11:53.094 --> 11:55.043
How to remove it?

11:55.044 --> 11:55.973
Granny.

11:55.974 --> 11:58.373
You can't remove it.

11:58.374 --> 11:59.563
I'm uncomfortable.

11:59.564 --> 12:00.923
You shouldn't.

12:00.924 --> 12:03.684
The police will fine 200 yuan.

12:17.444 --> 12:18.564
Granny?

12:22.164 --> 12:23.244
No way.

12:27.214 --> 12:28.683
OK.

12:28.684 --> 12:29.804
Arrived.

12:30.804 --> 12:32.324
Granny, let me help you.

12:33.044 --> 12:34.724
Are you feeling better?

12:36.894 --> 12:37.893
Thanks, Xiaochun.

12:37.894 --> 12:39.163
Shall I pick you up later?

12:39.164 --> 12:39.644
No, thanks.

12:39.645 --> 12:40.643
We'll be back by taxi.

12:40.644 --> 12:41.724
OK.

12:44.924 --> 12:45.564
I have to go.

12:45.564 --> 12:46.334
Thanks.

12:46.334 --> 12:46.684
Bye-bye.

12:46.684 --> 12:47.764
Go.

12:49.804 --> 12:50.563
Where?

12:50.564 --> 12:51.644
Go ahead.

12:52.044 --> 12:53.124
This way.

12:57.924 --> 12:59.084
How much is it?

12:59.924 --> 13:01.414
15.

13:01.684 --> 13:02.923
Cheaper?

13:02.924 --> 13:03.334
Granny.

13:03.335 --> 13:05.013
It's the lowest price.

13:05.014 --> 13:05.893
10 yuan.

13:05.894 --> 13:06.893
13.

13:06.894 --> 13:08.043
10.

13:08.044 --> 13:08.644
12.

13:08.645 --> 13:09.523
It's the lowest.

13:09.524 --> 13:10.563
Nine?

13:10.564 --> 13:10.974
OK.

13:10.975 --> 13:12.374
10 yuan.

13:16.444 --> 13:17.214
Come on, granny.

13:17.214 --> 13:17.684
I've paid it.

13:17.685 --> 13:18.683
Let's go.

13:18.684 --> 13:20.043
I'll give you the money.

13:20.044 --> 13:22.044
It's for you. Let's go.

13:22.444 --> 13:23.524
Wait.

13:23.804 --> 13:25.163
Hello, President Xie.

13:25.164 --> 13:26.654
We're looking for Yuan.

13:28.494 --> 13:30.523
Granny, it's Yao.

13:30.524 --> 13:31.724
Don't mention him.

13:32.404 --> 13:33.484
OK.

13:43.764 --> 13:45.174
Terrible.

13:48.334 --> 13:50.213
Welcome!

13:50.214 --> 13:50.894
You two?

13:50.895 --> 13:53.163
I have a question. Does Xie Zhiyuan work here?

13:53.164 --> 13:54.563
Xie Zhiyuan?

13:54.564 --> 13:54.974
Yes.

13:54.975 --> 13:56.523
He is 16 or 17 years old.

13:56.524 --> 13:57.443
Welcome!

13:57.444 --> 13:58.524
Is he?

14:04.284 --> 14:05.414
Granny!

14:16.254 --> 14:21.613
How dare you run away from home?

14:21.614 --> 14:22.164
Granny!

14:22.164 --> 14:22.853
Go home!

14:22.854 --> 14:24.044
Ouch! Granny!

14:39.924 --> 14:40.564
Granny!

14:40.565 --> 14:41.493
Granny, stop!

14:41.494 --> 14:41.894
Granny!

14:41.895 --> 14:42.973
You shouldn't hit me.

14:42.974 --> 14:44.374
Granny, stop!

15:11.134 --> 15:13.133
How much is a catty of milk fans?

15:13.134 --> 15:14.444
55 yuan.

15:14.684 --> 15:15.334
Have a try.

15:15.334 --> 15:15.734
Homemade.

15:15.735 --> 15:16.894
No, thanks.

17:05.484 --> 17:06.203
Granny.

17:06.204 --> 17:07.524
All dishes ready.

17:09.244 --> 17:10.443
Liang.

17:10.444 --> 17:12.203
Haven't seen you for a long time.

17:12.204 --> 17:14.894
Didn't you go to
Ruili with your mother?

17:15.134 --> 17:17.443
I was not used to living there.

17:17.444 --> 17:18.684
So I came back.

17:19.374 --> 17:20.964
Let's eat together.

17:24.294 --> 17:25.373
Thanks, granny.

17:25.374 --> 17:27.524
I'm still at work.

17:33.894 --> 17:36.243
Here's the spoon.

17:36.244 --> 17:37.893
I won't hit you.

17:37.894 --> 17:39.403
Have hotpot.

17:39.404 --> 17:43.054
Even if the sky collapses,
we must have lunch.

17:49.574 --> 17:51.893
When your father called me

17:51.894 --> 17:53.853
and told me he would send you here,

17:53.854 --> 17:57.524
I planned to hit you home.

17:57.924 --> 18:00.203
His father said I don't understand education.

18:00.204 --> 18:01.483
He said I shouldn't beat him

18:01.484 --> 18:03.654
and we should let him wake up himself.

18:04.294 --> 18:05.293
Yes.

18:05.294 --> 18:09.854
Granny, there is
International Spank-Out Day.

18:10.294 --> 18:11.374
What day?

18:12.374 --> 18:14.893
It is similar to Children's Day.

18:14.894 --> 18:17.724
On that day, parents
can't beat their children.

18:18.094 --> 18:19.643
Not today, right?

18:19.644 --> 18:22.174
Except for that
day, can I beat him?

18:23.644 --> 18:25.893
I can't beat him?

18:25.894 --> 18:28.333
He needs a spanking.

18:28.334 --> 18:30.963
He is spoiled and does as he pleases.

18:30.964 --> 18:33.444
I can't beat him when he doesn't go to school.

18:34.094 --> 18:37.093
Then, he runs away from home.

18:37.094 --> 18:40.893
If I don't beat him,
he'll become a thief

18:40.894 --> 18:42.773
just like Xie Qiang.

18:42.774 --> 18:43.854
Granny!

18:49.164 --> 18:50.724
That's all.

18:51.164 --> 18:52.244
Eat.

18:58.204 --> 18:59.203
Thanks.

18:59.204 --> 19:00.444
Thanks, granny.

19:04.854 --> 19:05.964
Granny.

19:06.294 --> 19:07.573
I'll go to work.

19:07.574 --> 19:09.414
As a student, why do you work?

19:10.614 --> 19:12.053
Go home with me later.

19:12.054 --> 19:13.854
I'll ask your dad to pick you up.

19:14.774 --> 19:16.053
Granny.

19:16.054 --> 19:17.963
I have to work for two more days this week

19:17.964 --> 19:19.614
so as to get the salary.

19:25.054 --> 19:26.654
Go.

19:27.244 --> 19:29.244
Comb your hair first.

19:34.614 --> 19:35.854
I have to go, granny.

19:39.244 --> 19:41.524
Why do you let him work?

19:42.404 --> 19:44.393
He gets a weekly salary here.

19:44.394 --> 19:46.483
He's worked for 5 days. 2 days doesn't matter.

19:46.484 --> 19:48.333
Let him finish it.

19:48.334 --> 19:50.923
But you should
tell me where he is.

19:50.924 --> 19:52.573
I know you well.

19:52.574 --> 19:54.773
If I tell you, you'll
come at once

19:54.774 --> 19:56.684
and destroy all my plans.

19:58.204 --> 20:00.244
When did you know he is here?

20:00.684 --> 20:02.284
I knew it when he just came.

20:05.574 --> 20:06.924
I have an informer.

20:07.534 --> 20:09.373
Welcome!

20:09.374 --> 20:11.403
You should be louder.

20:11.404 --> 20:13.333
Welcome!

20:13.334 --> 20:14.773
Have a sense of rhythm.

20:14.774 --> 20:16.243
Welcome!

20:16.244 --> 20:18.814
Be enthusiastic and brave.

20:23.334 --> 20:26.163
♫ Be brave! ♫

20:26.164 --> 20:29.243
♫ The so-called dark night ♫

20:29.244 --> 20:35.243
♫ is just what I thought to be ♫

20:35.244 --> 20:41.574
♫ I think those detours in life ♫

20:44.774 --> 20:45.534
Liang.

20:45.535 --> 20:46.643
I want to wash my hands.

20:46.644 --> 20:47.164
Stomachache.

20:47.165 --> 20:48.724
Go.

20:58.134 --> 20:59.214
Yao?

20:59.894 --> 21:00.974
Xie...

21:06.004 --> 21:07.813
You've learned
smoking and drinking?

21:07.814 --> 21:09.003
No.

21:09.004 --> 21:09.723
Seldom.

21:09.724 --> 21:10.804
Seldom?

21:11.404 --> 21:12.894
I won't smoke anymore.

21:14.644 --> 21:15.853
Why are you here?

21:15.854 --> 21:17.764
Didn't your mother take you to Ruili?

21:18.244 --> 21:19.963
There are too many people.

21:19.964 --> 21:21.654
I'd better return and work.

21:26.724 --> 21:28.573
Why did Yuan find you?

21:28.574 --> 21:31.923
We often play games with Xiaxia.

21:31.924 --> 21:34.923
He came in a sudden and
wanted to work with me.

21:34.924 --> 21:36.574
You're playing

21:36.894 --> 21:38.724
and singing hand in hand, right?

21:40.334 --> 21:42.053
Yao, why not take him back?

21:42.054 --> 21:43.573
He has never suffered.

21:43.574 --> 21:45.333
It's tiring to work in the restaurant.

21:45.334 --> 21:47.054
I won't take him back.

21:48.404 --> 21:49.524
Do me a favor.

21:49.854 --> 21:51.243
Take him to work.

21:51.244 --> 21:52.533
Keep an eye on him.

21:52.534 --> 21:55.814
Every night, report his
work to me by phone.

21:56.094 --> 21:57.174
What?

21:57.484 --> 21:59.533
It's a betrayal of my friend.

21:59.534 --> 22:00.964
I'm not such a man.

22:05.574 --> 22:07.334
Will you betray him

22:08.444 --> 22:10.334
or betray me?

22:10.964 --> 22:12.204
Make a choice.

22:18.444 --> 22:20.284
I'll betray him.

22:21.134 --> 22:22.484
Good.

22:23.334 --> 22:24.963
It's not a betrayal.

22:24.964 --> 22:26.724
I want to help him.

22:27.774 --> 22:29.894
Liang!

22:30.684 --> 22:32.203
So quickly!

22:32.204 --> 22:33.093
He has a good digestive system.

22:33.094 --> 22:34.003
Go back.

22:34.004 --> 22:35.084
Wait.

22:45.684 --> 22:46.764
Liang!

22:49.164 --> 22:50.244
Liang!

22:51.244 --> 22:52.324
Take it.

22:53.644 --> 22:55.054
Eat something good.

22:55.334 --> 22:56.574
Don't buy cigarettes.

22:56.854 --> 22:57.934
Thanks, Yao.

22:58.614 --> 22:59.854
I have to go.

23:02.814 --> 23:03.894
Liang!

23:04.134 --> 23:05.003
Liang!

23:05.004 --> 23:05.724
Liang!

23:05.725 --> 23:07.163
Why did you go so far?

23:07.164 --> 23:08.814
It's smelly here.

23:09.484 --> 23:11.643
I ate too much.

23:11.644 --> 23:12.333
Go back.

23:12.334 --> 23:13.414
OK.

23:19.404 --> 23:21.403
You fixed a location on him?

23:21.404 --> 23:23.403
I don't have to do that.

23:23.404 --> 23:25.243
He uses my old phone.

23:25.244 --> 23:26.963
All the accounts in it are mine.

23:26.964 --> 23:29.403
Since he seldom read
books, he doesn't know it.

23:29.404 --> 23:31.244
It's the same as fixing a location.

23:31.484 --> 23:33.093
My dad left him here.

23:33.094 --> 23:34.683
He's like a wild horse.

23:34.684 --> 23:37.244
If I don't use high-tech,
I can't control him.

23:38.004 --> 23:39.053
Why not tell us?

23:39.054 --> 23:40.924
Many villagers are talking about you.

23:41.244 --> 23:43.133
There is no secret in the village.

23:43.134 --> 23:46.053
Shut up if you don't
want others to know.

23:46.054 --> 23:47.333
He has a planted agent.

23:47.334 --> 23:50.333
Xiaxia pouts his chin
every time he tells a lie.

23:50.334 --> 23:50.964
Bro.

23:50.965 --> 23:52.333
I know nothing.

23:52.334 --> 23:54.004
Obviously, he lies.

23:56.614 --> 23:58.414
Even I can't know it?

24:00.134 --> 24:01.483
You are the number one suspect

24:01.484 --> 24:03.334
of secret propagation.

24:03.644 --> 24:05.044
Even granny doesn't know it.

24:05.484 --> 24:07.773
However, I told Auntie Feng.

24:07.774 --> 24:09.054
She's tight-lipped.

24:09.644 --> 24:11.723
She just told me he found Yuan
who was undergoing

24:11.724 --> 24:12.893
reform through labor.

24:12.894 --> 24:15.004
He let me not worry.

24:15.684 --> 24:16.723
Look.

24:16.724 --> 24:19.133
That's why I don't let granny deal with it.

24:19.134 --> 24:21.103
If granny were 20 years old,

24:21.104 --> 24:23.184
she could win the Women's Sanda Championship.

24:24.444 --> 24:25.243
Listen.

24:25.244 --> 24:26.403
When my grandpa was young,

24:26.404 --> 24:28.923
he was caught by granny
because he sang very well.

24:28.924 --> 24:29.923
Caught him home?

24:29.924 --> 24:30.963
Yes.

24:30.964 --> 24:32.963
My grandpa was popular.

24:32.964 --> 24:35.723
Though my granny was not beautiful,

24:35.724 --> 24:37.654
she was quite strong.

24:38.924 --> 24:40.643
Do you think I can't beat you?

24:40.644 --> 24:41.573
You're beautiful.

24:41.574 --> 24:42.963
Most beautiful.

24:42.964 --> 24:44.643
Don't listen to him.

24:44.644 --> 24:46.643
He must be talking nonsense.

24:46.644 --> 24:49.923
You must be a beauty when young.

24:49.924 --> 24:51.814
You are a beauty.

24:52.374 --> 24:54.054
You are flattering each other.

24:54.294 --> 24:55.414
Flattering?

24:56.334 --> 24:58.293
It must be bad words.

24:58.294 --> 24:58.814
Yes.

24:58.815 --> 25:00.533
We're not flattering.

25:00.534 --> 25:04.244
This is mutual appreciation
between women.

25:06.094 --> 25:06.894
Don't talk to him.

25:06.894 --> 25:07.974
Let's eat.

25:09.444 --> 25:11.484
Well, take photos.

25:15.894 --> 25:16.643
Come on.

25:16.644 --> 25:17.404
President Xie.

25:17.405 --> 25:19.004
Granny, look at here.

25:20.134 --> 25:21.533
V gesture is outdated.

25:21.534 --> 25:22.683
Finger heart.

25:22.684 --> 25:24.004
That's outdated.

25:28.814 --> 25:30.414
Did I close my eyes?

25:32.204 --> 25:33.333
Great.

25:33.334 --> 25:34.524
Let me see.

25:38.004 --> 25:39.084
Eat more.

25:40.334 --> 25:42.133
Granny. You gave her all the meat.

25:42.134 --> 25:43.133
I just boiled it.

25:43.134 --> 25:44.963
Let's boil more.

25:44.964 --> 25:45.853
That's enough.

25:45.854 --> 25:46.773
Eat more.

25:46.774 --> 25:47.854
Thanks.

26:04.964 --> 26:06.054
That's all.

26:11.374 --> 26:12.614
Say something.

26:13.644 --> 26:14.764
Say what?

26:15.444 --> 26:16.443
You can scold me.

26:16.444 --> 26:17.524
Don't hold.

26:18.004 --> 26:20.334
Whenever I want to scold you, I never restrain.

26:24.244 --> 26:25.324
Well.

26:26.244 --> 26:29.684
Anyway, don't let mom know.

26:30.684 --> 26:31.894
She is so thrifty.

26:32.374 --> 26:35.133
She even cares about 0.1 yuan

26:35.134 --> 26:36.414
when buying vegetables.

26:36.644 --> 26:38.093
If she finds she's cheated a lot,

26:38.094 --> 26:39.414
she'll keep silent

26:39.644 --> 26:41.284
but will have poor sleep.

26:43.484 --> 26:44.564
As for money,

26:45.004 --> 26:46.764
don't borrow from Yao.

26:47.164 --> 26:50.764
I have some savings to
make up your 30000 yuan.

26:51.244 --> 26:52.813
It is good to recover

26:52.814 --> 26:55.003
the money of telecom fraud.

26:55.004 --> 26:56.444
If not,

26:56.814 --> 26:58.244
don't think too much.

26:58.724 --> 26:59.893
It's just a lesson.

26:59.894 --> 27:01.484
Let bygones be bygones.

27:02.004 --> 27:05.004
Yao won't mention this matter.

27:05.614 --> 27:07.134
No one should mention it.

27:08.814 --> 27:09.894
Don't look at me!

27:11.164 --> 27:12.293
You won't scold me?

27:12.294 --> 27:13.443
I've scolded you a lot.

27:13.444 --> 27:14.924
But you never keep it in mind.

27:15.164 --> 27:18.244
Don't you know your
educational level?

27:18.484 --> 27:20.133
They didn't let you tell your family

27:20.134 --> 27:21.333
to avoid being seen through.

27:21.334 --> 27:23.923
Do you think it's easy to make money?

27:23.924 --> 27:25.203
I have a question.

27:25.204 --> 27:27.813
Have mom and I ever
asked you for any money?

27:27.814 --> 27:29.293
Where's your pressure?

27:29.294 --> 27:30.243
The outer world is so good

27:30.244 --> 27:31.924
that you hate staying at home?

27:34.894 --> 27:36.444
Do you think I'm blaming you?

27:39.534 --> 27:41.204
I don't hate staying at home.

27:43.094 --> 27:44.764
I just want to make more money.

27:46.134 --> 27:48.094
The business of wood carving is not good.

27:48.644 --> 27:50.244
Without me,

27:51.004 --> 27:53.284
Master can pay less minimum wage.

27:54.344 --> 27:55.964
Yao returns to start a business.

27:56.724 --> 27:58.924
You quit your job in Kunming and went home.

28:00.094 --> 28:01.163
In the past three years,

28:01.164 --> 28:03.053
he has invested a lot of money.

28:03.054 --> 28:05.854
He hires many people and pays a lot of salaries

28:06.164 --> 28:07.574
but few tourists come.

28:10.774 --> 28:13.244
Selling produce online only makes
a small profit.

28:13.614 --> 28:14.483
It's beyond means.

28:14.484 --> 28:16.054
You can't get any dividends.

28:17.004 --> 28:18.854
Why do you care about it?

28:19.484 --> 28:21.484
After all, I'm the only man in my family.

28:22.814 --> 28:24.853
It's my turn to support the family.

28:24.854 --> 28:26.334
We can't only rely on you.

28:37.484 --> 28:40.764
Do you think I'm stupid
and think too much?

28:44.644 --> 28:45.923
I know I'm stupid.

28:45.924 --> 28:47.244
You are stupid.

28:49.724 --> 28:51.373
Do you know what is

28:51.374 --> 28:53.623
wearing one's learning lightly?

28:53.624 --> 28:55.664
If conditions are ripe, success will come.

28:56.004 --> 28:58.773
There is water in the river. We have to
dig ditches

28:58.774 --> 29:01.174
before we can draw water to the ground.

29:01.684 --> 29:04.093
Many things need to
be done step by step.

29:04.094 --> 29:05.334
Take it easy.

29:05.854 --> 29:09.613
Huailan has been an embroiderer all her life.

29:09.614 --> 29:11.293
Now everyone respects her

29:11.294 --> 29:14.244
and calls her Teacher Xie.

29:15.404 --> 29:19.094
You learned wood carving from your master
before.

29:19.644 --> 29:21.533
You studied hard during the day

29:21.534 --> 29:22.893
and practiced hard at night.

29:22.894 --> 29:24.414
After learning for years,

29:24.724 --> 29:28.003
you finally carved a
worthless old wooden basin

29:28.004 --> 29:29.764
into a handicraft and sold it.

29:30.854 --> 29:34.443
Therefore, many things
need long-term vision

29:34.444 --> 29:36.293
and should be accumulated slowly.

29:36.294 --> 29:37.793
But you can't see that.

29:37.794 --> 29:38.893
You're always in a hurry.

29:38.894 --> 29:40.414
Aren't you stupid?

29:41.544 --> 29:44.163
Master's always accumulated but makes
little money.

29:44.164 --> 29:47.894
Tell me how much money is enough?

29:51.484 --> 29:54.293
Your master can
support his family

29:54.294 --> 29:56.813
by his own skills and
then spread the skills

29:56.814 --> 29:59.373
so that those who learn from him can also
support their families.

29:59.374 --> 30:00.684
Is it enough?

30:03.404 --> 30:05.053
I saw it on the Internet...

30:05.054 --> 30:07.533
Don't always listen to others.

30:07.534 --> 30:09.764
Can you think independently?

30:10.004 --> 30:12.963
Just as I said, it's not
easy to make money.

30:12.964 --> 30:14.893
When encountering problems, we should

30:14.894 --> 30:17.443
think about how to
sell our good products.

30:17.444 --> 30:18.893
But you only run.

30:18.894 --> 30:20.003
Xie Xiaoxia.

30:20.004 --> 30:21.443
Do you know what your deed is?

30:21.444 --> 30:23.853
Gluttonous, lazy, overambitious and indolent.

30:23.854 --> 30:25.814
You're good for nothing.

30:28.094 --> 30:29.524
Come on, that's all.

30:29.894 --> 30:31.284
Think carefully.

30:35.964 --> 30:37.134
I know.

30:37.534 --> 30:38.764
You know?

30:43.894 --> 30:45.533
Can I have a try?

30:45.534 --> 30:46.094
OK.

30:46.095 --> 30:47.003
It's homemade.

30:47.004 --> 30:48.334
Have a try.

30:48.724 --> 30:49.804
Come on.

30:52.534 --> 30:53.243
Have a taste.

30:53.244 --> 30:54.414
Thanks.

30:56.724 --> 30:57.853
How much?

30:57.854 --> 30:58.773
55 yuan per catty.

30:58.774 --> 30:59.854
55?

31:00.444 --> 31:00.894
Want some?

31:00.895 --> 31:02.683
How much is a bag?

31:02.684 --> 31:04.004
Let me weigh it.

31:04.294 --> 31:05.053
Come on.

31:05.054 --> 31:06.134
Bag.

31:15.684 --> 31:17.524
It weighs 650 grams.

31:17.854 --> 31:19.643
It's 71.5 yuan in total.

31:19.644 --> 31:20.813
70 is OK.

31:20.814 --> 31:21.374
Thanks.

31:21.375 --> 31:22.373
You're welcome.

31:22.374 --> 31:23.924
Wechat pay.

31:24.724 --> 31:25.804
QR code.

31:33.374 --> 31:34.053
OK.

31:34.054 --> 31:34.644
Here you are.

31:34.644 --> 31:35.444
Thank you.

31:35.444 --> 31:36.524
You're welcome.

31:48.334 --> 31:50.133
Do you want your brother to drive you home

31:50.134 --> 31:52.004
or to go home on your own?

31:52.294 --> 31:53.654
On my own.

31:54.054 --> 31:58.094
What did your father say on the phone?

31:58.644 --> 32:00.403
He'll ask the uncle in the village

32:00.404 --> 32:02.414
to take me home.

32:06.004 --> 32:07.484
Did I hit you hard?

32:19.854 --> 32:20.574
Come on, granny.

32:20.575 --> 32:21.683
Don't look at it.

32:21.684 --> 32:23.094
Soaked in water.

32:23.374 --> 32:24.454
I'm fine.

32:25.814 --> 32:26.894
Yuan.

32:27.244 --> 32:31.373
You should study hard.

32:31.374 --> 32:33.333
Otherwise, the slap of life

32:33.334 --> 32:36.614
is much more painful than my slap.

32:38.374 --> 32:39.454
Granny.

32:39.774 --> 32:40.773
Go.

32:40.774 --> 32:41.723
OK.

32:41.724 --> 32:43.293
Go on with your work.

32:43.294 --> 32:44.373
They pay you a salary.

32:44.374 --> 32:46.004
Don't be lazy.

32:46.244 --> 32:46.854
Got it.

32:46.855 --> 32:48.093
Yuan.

32:48.094 --> 32:50.923
I didn't spread your incident.

32:50.924 --> 32:52.654
Trust me.

32:53.294 --> 32:54.813
I trust you.

32:54.814 --> 32:56.524
What's your attitude?

32:57.004 --> 32:59.163
Since I trust you, my
attitude doesn't matter.

32:59.164 --> 32:59.774
Come on.

32:59.775 --> 33:01.093
I've made it clear.

33:01.094 --> 33:02.373
You don't know others.

33:02.374 --> 33:04.004
Don't mention it.

33:05.204 --> 33:06.524
Granny, look at him!

33:07.244 --> 33:07.774
Miss! Miss!

33:07.774 --> 33:08.854
Miss!

33:09.484 --> 33:11.134
Go.

33:12.004 --> 33:13.284
Granny, take care.

33:14.374 --> 33:16.054
Granny, this way.

33:30.294 --> 33:33.293
I have to leave. Some cocoons will arrive
this afternoon.

33:33.294 --> 33:34.163
Are you full?

33:34.164 --> 33:35.373
Shall I buy you milk tea?

33:35.374 --> 33:36.613
I'm full.

33:36.614 --> 33:37.764
Listen.

33:38.054 --> 33:39.643
Don't expose the truth

33:39.644 --> 33:40.853
when you go home days later.

33:40.854 --> 33:41.934
Understand?

33:43.774 --> 33:45.334
Throw it. I shall leave.

33:48.484 --> 33:49.564
Xiaochun.

33:50.374 --> 33:51.454
What?

34:05.374 --> 34:06.654
Sorry.

34:14.484 --> 34:16.804
What are you doing? Disgusting!

34:18.924 --> 34:19.694
Don't make me angry.

34:19.695 --> 34:21.253
That will be fine.

34:21.254 --> 34:22.334
OK.

34:24.174 --> 34:25.654
Bye-bye.

34:29.774 --> 34:31.563
Why did I say "disgusting"?

34:31.564 --> 34:33.404
Why did I say that?

34:33.924 --> 34:35.244
I...

34:35.694 --> 34:37.174
Why did I hug her?

34:38.254 --> 34:39.974
I want to die!

35:12.404 --> 35:14.094
This is Erhai Lake.

35:14.484 --> 35:16.043
The afternoon sun

35:16.044 --> 35:18.614
shines on the water surface, sparkling.

35:18.894 --> 35:20.773
Cangshan Mountain is far away.

35:20.774 --> 35:22.534
How magnificent!

35:23.294 --> 35:25.183
There is a little snow on it.

35:25.184 --> 35:27.014
But I can't see clearly in the video.

35:27.694 --> 35:29.724
I also wrote that
in primary school.

35:31.404 --> 35:34.123
This is our landlord, Xie Zhiyao.

35:34.124 --> 35:36.373
He is just so-so.

35:36.374 --> 35:38.083
Just so so?

35:38.084 --> 35:39.934
Let me introduce myself.

35:40.174 --> 35:41.733
I'm Xie Zhiyao.

35:41.734 --> 35:43.773
I'm handsome, casual and elegant bearing.

35:43.774 --> 35:45.373
I'm tall, stately and powerful.

35:45.374 --> 35:47.043
I'm the village beau.

35:47.044 --> 35:48.333
So cold. Pass.

35:48.334 --> 35:49.213
Cold?

35:49.214 --> 35:50.294
I haven't finished.

35:51.654 --> 35:55.083
This is cool Granny Xie.

35:55.084 --> 35:56.244
She is kind,

35:56.694 --> 35:59.134
beautiful and good at beating.

35:59.524 --> 36:01.123
I never beat anyone.

36:01.124 --> 36:02.844
It's uncivilized behavior.

36:04.254 --> 36:05.483
She beat a rebellious boy

36:05.484 --> 36:08.773
who ran away from
home and didn't study hard

36:08.774 --> 36:10.134
in the hotpot shop.

36:10.564 --> 36:11.443
It's windy.

36:11.444 --> 36:13.094
We are on our way back now.

36:14.254 --> 36:15.373
Xu Hongdou.

36:15.374 --> 36:17.173
Where did you send the video?

36:17.174 --> 36:18.254
Family group.

36:19.254 --> 36:20.853
I was kidding.

36:20.854 --> 36:21.693
Xu Hongdou.

36:21.694 --> 36:23.814
Take a new video. I'll introduce myself again.

36:26.044 --> 36:27.773
Just so-so?

36:27.774 --> 36:29.893
Let me introduce myself.

36:29.894 --> 36:31.253
I'm Xie Zhiyao.

36:31.254 --> 36:33.173
I'm handsome, casual and elegant bearing.

36:33.174 --> 36:34.963
I'm tall, stately and powerful.

36:34.964 --> 36:36.884
I'm the most handsome one in the village.

36:37.294 --> 36:38.653
So cold. Pass.

36:38.654 --> 36:40.333
Cold? I haven't finished.

36:40.334 --> 36:41.654
What a man!

36:42.004 --> 36:43.364
They're crazy!

36:43.924 --> 36:45.483
How happy they are!

36:45.484 --> 36:47.603
I'm afraid they can't find the hotel.

36:47.604 --> 36:48.483
That's good.

36:48.484 --> 36:51.293
Young people can't
just lie on the sofa

36:51.294 --> 36:52.923
and hold their phones, right?

36:52.924 --> 36:55.293
They laugh like an idiot

36:55.294 --> 36:57.213
or are as mad as a hornet.

36:57.214 --> 36:58.603
That's abnormal.

36:58.604 --> 37:00.284
But she is great.

37:00.854 --> 37:02.003
Xu Hongdou.

37:02.004 --> 37:03.733
Where did you send the video?

37:03.734 --> 37:04.814
Family group.

37:05.214 --> 37:06.724
The boy is energetic.

37:07.334 --> 37:07.964
Of course.

37:07.965 --> 37:09.893
He is the most handsome guy in the village.

37:09.894 --> 37:11.764
Look at his white teeth.

37:13.964 --> 37:15.853
My teeth are also white.

37:15.854 --> 37:17.293
You can't compare to him.

37:17.294 --> 37:18.884
You're so bothersome.

37:19.854 --> 37:21.534
Once more.

37:28.454 --> 37:33.074
♫ The sun will rise and fall ♫

37:38.794 --> 37:43.574
♫ It's just another day ♫

37:57.084 --> 37:58.284
Have you found that?

38:01.004 --> 38:02.454
What?

38:03.814 --> 38:05.324
It's a website.

38:06.174 --> 38:07.333
Phishing site.

38:07.334 --> 38:08.454
Phishing?

38:08.924 --> 38:10.403
A new game?

38:10.404 --> 38:12.483
Are you addicted to Puzzle Bobble?

38:12.484 --> 38:14.884
Phishing sites are scams.

38:16.524 --> 38:19.934
I thought it was a game like Fish Game.

38:20.214 --> 38:21.173
No.

38:21.174 --> 38:22.844
How did you find that?

38:23.254 --> 38:25.094
So I was cheated.

38:26.254 --> 38:27.443
Xiaxia.

38:27.444 --> 38:29.813
Who can find that?

38:29.814 --> 38:30.894
Yes.

38:31.174 --> 38:32.804
Yao found that at once.

38:33.044 --> 38:34.654
Hongdou also found that.

38:35.734 --> 38:37.884
She said the yield was too high.

38:43.524 --> 38:44.693
Yuan.

38:44.694 --> 38:46.324
You should study hard.

38:52.924 --> 38:54.213
Xiaxia.

38:54.214 --> 38:56.884
Will you go to Shanghai?

38:57.604 --> 38:59.764
No. I have no money.

39:01.254 --> 39:03.443
And there's something I must figure out.

39:03.444 --> 39:04.534
Xiaxia.

39:05.004 --> 39:07.574
Are you brainwashed by your sister?

39:07.854 --> 39:09.813
Won't you go to Shanghai?

39:09.814 --> 39:11.083
I'm not brainwashed.

39:11.084 --> 39:12.693
My sister is well-educated.

39:12.694 --> 39:14.534
She knows more than I do.

39:14.924 --> 39:16.574
Education makes a difference.

39:17.694 --> 39:18.774
Yes.

39:19.174 --> 39:20.123
Yuan.

39:20.124 --> 39:21.853
Study hard when you return.

39:21.854 --> 39:23.174
Don't talk to me.

39:24.524 --> 39:26.284
You're still angry?

39:27.084 --> 39:28.293
We're bros.

39:28.294 --> 39:30.523
Even Xiaxia doesn't betray me but you do.

39:30.524 --> 39:32.043
I... I have no choice.

39:32.044 --> 39:35.253
Yao just pinned me on the wall.

39:35.254 --> 39:37.813
If I didn't agree, he
would blow my head off.

39:37.814 --> 39:38.484
I give you...

39:38.484 --> 39:39.564
Yuan.

39:40.294 --> 39:41.773
Don't blame Liang.

39:41.774 --> 39:43.043
Yao is clever.

39:43.044 --> 39:44.773
It doesn't matter you use his old phone.

39:44.774 --> 39:46.293
Why do you use his account?

39:46.294 --> 39:47.374
Are you stupid?

39:50.084 --> 39:52.373
I just want to play games.

39:52.374 --> 39:54.054
If I want to buy skins,

39:54.484 --> 39:57.094
I can directly use his money in the account.

39:57.814 --> 40:00.804
Even you can't beat
him, let alone Liang.

40:02.894 --> 40:04.094
Yes.

40:05.044 --> 40:08.123
He kicked me hard in the ass.

40:08.124 --> 40:10.094
My butt still hurts.

40:25.004 --> 40:26.454
I feel old.

40:27.604 --> 40:28.773
You're just 16.

40:28.774 --> 40:30.003
I'm 18.

40:30.004 --> 40:31.123
I'm old.

40:31.124 --> 40:32.204
Go away!

40:39.814 --> 40:40.934
One more round?

40:41.334 --> 40:42.173
OK.

40:42.174 --> 40:44.003
No, I'm not happy.

40:44.004 --> 40:45.574
You can use Baili Shouyue.

40:46.294 --> 40:48.094
I...

40:51.004 --> 40:52.084
Go.

40:59.334 --> 41:00.443
I haven't logged in.

41:00.444 --> 41:01.654
Let me invite you.

41:02.374 --> 41:02.964
Wait.

41:02.965 --> 41:04.373
I haven't logged in.

41:04.374 --> 41:06.204
Does Baili Shouyue have any skin?

41:10.084 --> 41:13.284
Have some black tea at night.

41:13.924 --> 41:16.123
Remember to make tea at a low temperature.

41:16.124 --> 41:19.083
It will dissolve more theanine and glutamic acid

41:19.084 --> 41:20.654
and help you sleep.

41:21.524 --> 41:23.614
Hey, Damai!

41:24.444 --> 41:26.653
What wind blew you here?

41:26.654 --> 41:28.534
I seldom see you downstairs.

41:28.774 --> 41:30.494
Mr. Ma. Nana.

41:32.004 --> 41:33.173
You three are here.

41:33.174 --> 41:34.693
Only one left.

41:34.694 --> 41:35.523
Hongdou.

41:35.524 --> 41:36.604
I'll call her.

41:37.334 --> 41:38.253
No.

41:38.254 --> 41:39.044
She's tired.

41:39.045 --> 41:41.574
We asked her to have
tea but she refused.

41:42.524 --> 41:45.094
What happened?

41:45.484 --> 41:48.003
I promised to give her a reception.

41:48.004 --> 41:49.923
But it's been a long time.

41:49.924 --> 41:52.174
I'll send her out.

41:52.444 --> 41:54.574
You mean "see her off"?

41:55.694 --> 41:56.844
Just the same.

41:58.694 --> 42:01.654
Is she afraid of me?

42:02.484 --> 42:04.083
Why is she avoiding me?

42:04.084 --> 42:05.963
No one is avoiding you.

42:05.964 --> 42:07.764
It's your fault.

42:08.964 --> 42:10.844
You all said I'm a playboy.

42:11.564 --> 42:13.923
We never say you're a playboy.

42:13.924 --> 42:16.813
By the way, playboy
is an outdated word.

42:16.814 --> 42:18.934
Only the seniors like my mom use it.

42:19.294 --> 42:20.804
Now we use Poseidon.

42:22.564 --> 42:24.523
I know Poseidon.

42:24.524 --> 42:28.523
He holds a trident and
has a lot of chest hair.

42:28.524 --> 42:29.844
That man, right?

42:33.734 --> 42:35.403
Knowing you know nothing

42:35.404 --> 42:38.614
is the beginning of wisdom.

42:40.124 --> 42:41.213
Know?

42:41.214 --> 42:42.934
Your words make me painful.

42:44.374 --> 42:46.844
I recently wrote a new song.

42:48.404 --> 42:51.454
Lonely Men.

42:57.054 --> 43:02.524
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

43:04.494 --> 43:09.444
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

43:11.904 --> 43:17.954
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

43:18.274 --> 43:23.654
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

43:26.614 --> 43:32.004
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

43:33.984 --> 43:38.844
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

43:41.414 --> 43:47.614
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

43:47.944 --> 43:54.134
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

43:56.224 --> 44:02.663
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

44:02.664 --> 44:09.414
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

44:10.794 --> 44:12.843
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

44:12.844 --> 44:17.234
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

44:17.474 --> 44:24.704
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

